DESCRIPTION:<p>In this interactive session\, you'll get an up-close look a
 t the Office for Institutional Equity\, our mission\, our programs\, and 
 the individuals and communities at the center of everything we do. Come r
 eady to engage\, ask questions\, and discover how we can work together to
  advance inclusive excellence across the enterprise.\n    \nFacilitated b
 y: <strong>Elizabeth Jones\, Ph.D.</strong>\, Director for Education and 
 Outreach &amp\; <strong>Genevieve Barnes</strong>\, <strong>M.S. M.A</str
 ong>. Assistant Director for Education and Outreach\n\n        <strong>Tu
 esday\, June 2\, 2026 | 10:00 AM - 11:00 AM | </strong><a href="https://d
 uke.zoom.us/meeting/register/KIepdJGtRpmcDJ02TqgynQ#/registration"><stron
 g>REGISTER HERE (Zoom)</strong></a>\n</p>
DURATION:PT1H
