DESCRIPTION:The postgrad scholarship advisors at Duke will be hosting an i
 nformation session on June 2nd for juniors\, seniors\, and young alumni w
 ho are interested in learning about scholarship opportunities to pay for 
 graduate study\, research\, or teaching English after graduation. The ses
 sion will be offered twice\, at 12pm Eastern and 3pm Eastern\, using the 
 same Zoom link. Hope to see you there!
