  club atmosphere where members learn and practice together. \n\nYou are w
 armly invited to experience Toastmasters as our guest -- for free! Join u
 s for a high-impact\, one-hour hybrid meeting. Attend in-person or online
 !\n\nIn-person: Conference Room A at Duke Regional Hospital -- use the Be
 havioral Health Center entrance.\n\nOnline: Get the Zoom link -- https://
 duke.zoom.us/meeting/register/R0x2pwFFRtypkhrgL90i5g#/registration\n\nMor
 e about Blue Devil Toastmasters: https://bluedevil.toastmastersclubs.org/
 
